      "value": "Some info that could bring us some insights.\n- Are you using the default base locomotion layer from the sdk.\n- Is the 6pt force locomotion disable or enable in the descriptor.\n- What is the Idle animation of standing/crouching.\n- Is the additive layer use.\n- The world/avatar are using SDK 2 or 3.\n- Have you try a different IK controller.\n- What happen if you physically rotate in that direction.",
      "viewerReactions": null
