  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It seems that whenever I turn my avatar (all of them) into a certain direction in any world, that the IK for the upper body (chest, shoulders and neck) seem to make slight rotations, resulting in different and sometimes weird results on a couple of avatars. Its noticeable on pretty much every avatar if one is sitting on a couch (meaning leaned back) and just uses the controller to rotate, that the chest goes up and down. \nI will attach a picture of the range I saw in my world as well as this video where i stand completly still only using my controller to rotate. https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/776651051859705887/833619605364539392/0001-ikbug.mp4\nI talked to a couple of people (creators and dancers), all of them noticed that behaviour to some degree already.",
